.git
.github
# 文档不进镜像；backend/pyproject.toml 用 readme = "README.md"，后端自己那份会被单独 COPY
*.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
htmlcov
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
# 运行期数据不入镜像；示例目录与出厂自定义命令需要保留以支持首次启动播种
**/data/*.yaml
!backend/data/*.example.yaml
!backend/data/commands.yaml
*.local.yaml
*.log
.env
.env.local
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
